Operational Guide for the Closed‑Loop Multi‑Physics Evolutionary System

1. System Overview

This system is a closed‑loop scientific computing environment that integrates:

Evolutionary design optimization

Multi‑physics simulation

Predictive forecasting

Pre‑violation mitigation triggers

Cryptographic provenance ledger

Lineage reconstruction

Multi‑run comparative analytics

ASCII visualization dashboards

Live time‑series plotting

Unified CLI orchestration

It behaves like a miniature mission‑control stack, capable of mutating designs, simulating their behavior, forecasting failure, preventing violations, and documenting every step.

